   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In August 2013, CDC invested &#xc4;20 million of equity capital into Jabong, a top Indian apparel ecommerce platform to help drive the growth of the business and develop its supply chain network. In 2015, CDC became a shareholder in GFG as a result of the merger of Jabong into GFG. In August 2015 and June 2016, CDC invested a further &#xc4;1.2 million and &#xc4;2.4 million, respectively, into GFG.</narrative>
   </description>
